{"id":"wb-6-946","name":"利济医学堂旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"利济医学堂旧址","text":"利济医学堂旧址位于浙江省瑞安市玉海街道办事处公园路10号。2006年5月25日，列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n利济医学堂创建于清朝光绪十一年（1885年），是陈虬、陈介石、陈葆善、何迪启等为推行改良维新主张所办的新式中医学堂。办学十几年，对中医事业的发展起过卓越作用。现存旧址是四合院型的中西混合建筑群，主楼面阔五间，西式构筑，其他皆中式木构筑，由门屋、厢房、主楼、中草药圃组成，现辟为利济医学堂博物馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%88%A9%E6%B5%8E%E5%8C%BB%E5%AD%A6%E5%A0%82%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":95091148,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95091148","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/50a265d9716b64b1432559a6.jpg","title":"Former_Site_of_Liji_Medical_School,_2021-05-02_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Former_Site_of_Liji_Medical_School,_2021-05-02_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/Former_Site_of_Liji_Medical_School%2C_2021-05-02_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​瑞安利济医学堂旧址","width":320,"height":214}}